e software ecosystem found in typical Linux distributions. Users familiar w ...\u003c/match_snippet\u003e\n\u003c/page\u003e\n\u003cpage\u003e\n\u003cknowledge_base_id\u003efed4ec72-0043-49ac-b350-19a4c5a3a581\u003c/knowledge_base_id\u003e\n\u003clink\u003e[[entity/apple|Apple]]\u003c/link\u003e\n\u003ctype\u003eentity\u003c/type\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eApple is the technology company that develops and owns the Macintosh computer line and its associated Mac OS operating system.\u003c/summary\u003e\n\u003cmatch_snippet\u003e... echnology company that develops and owns the [[entity/macintosh|Macintosh]] computer line and its associated [[entity/mac- ...\u003c/match_snippet\u003e\n\u003c/page\u003e\n\u003cpage\u003e\n\u003cknowledge_base_id\u003efed4ec72-0043-49ac-b350-19a4c5a3a581\u003c/knowledge_base_id\u003e\n\u003clink\u003e[[concept/unix-like-operating-system|Unix-like operating system]]\u003c/link\u003e\n\u003ctype\u003econcept\u003c/type\u003e\n\u003caliases\u003e类 Unix 操作系统\u003c/aliases\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eA Unix-like operating system is a category of systems behaving similarly to Unix, including Linux and FreeBSD, which share similar software ecosystems despite kernel differences.\u003c/summary\u003e\n\u003cmatch_snippet\u003e... lude FreeBSD. FreeBSD uses a different kernel, but it uses most of the same software found in typical Linux distributions. ...\u003c/match_snippet\u003e\n\u003c/page\u003e\n\u003cpage\u003e\n\u003cknowledge_base_id\u003efed4ec72-0043-49ac-b350-19a4c5a3a581\u003c/knowledge_base_id\u003e\n\u003clink\u003e[[index|Index]]\u003c/link\u003e\n\u003ctype\u003eindex\u003c/type\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003e# Wiki 索引\n\n本页面为自动更新的索引页，随新文档的添加而动态同步。近期新增内容涵盖了 DOS、Mac OS、UNIX 及 Linux 等主流操作系统的概述与对比，显著丰富了本站在计算平台领域的知识范围。\u003c/summary\u003e\n\u003cmatch_snippet\u003e... # Wiki 索引 本页面为自动更新的索引页，随新文档的添加而动态同步。近期新增内容涵盖了 DOS、Mac OS、UNIX 及 Linux 等主流操作系统的概述与对比，显著丰富了本站在计算平台领域的知识范围。 ...\u003c/match_snippet\u003e\n\u003c/page\u003e\n\u003cpage\u003e\n\u003ck